OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy start with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain moving
OL,7,Fnortheastwards. Turning dry and
OL,8,Fbrighter towards lunchtime, with
OL,9,Fplenty of sunshine developing for the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Breezy but feeling very
OL,11,Fwarm in the sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying dry with clear spells
OL,14,Fthis evening. Turning cloudier
OL,15,Fovernight with some outbreaks of rain
OL,16,Fand drizzle moving southeastwards. A
OL,17,Fmild and perhaps rather humid night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
