OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAny lingering rain quickly
OL,6,Fclearing, with bright or sunny spells
OL,7,Fdeveloping throughout the morning.
OL,8,FStaying dry with sunny spells
OL,9,Fthroughout the afternoon. Feeling
OL,10,Ffresher with temperatures nearer to
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,12,
OL,13,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,14,FSunshine and showers on Tuesday,
OL,15,Falthough showers easing later. Mostly
OL,16,Ffine and dry on Wednesday and
OL,17,FThursday, although patchy rain may
OL,18,Farrive late Thursday. Temperatures
OL,19,Fperhaps a little below average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
